# THE V3 SITE IS NOT PART OF THIS REPO.
# `NEWST V3/` is the old site, kept locally as archive material — it is where
# most of the project photography and renders still live, and the image
# pipeline reads from it. It is deliberately not pushed. See README.md for what
# that means for anyone cloning this: the built derivatives in
# `newstreet-v4/public/img/` ARE committed, so the site runs and builds without
# it; only regenerating images and project data needs the archive.
